# Carnage, Crimson Chaos: the returned creature's gained "When this creature deals combat damage to a player,
# sacrifice it." Carnage returns a Guerrilla Gorilla on turn 5. On turn 7 the Gorilla has to attack (no Attack line; the
# default declares none) and Bot2's Fanatic of Rhonas blocks it. The Gorilla deals its damage to the Fanatic only, so
# nothing triggers: it survives the 1 damage it takes and stays on the battlefield.

